  "summary": "Source macOS service evidence extends a bounded native workflow TaskIR adapter to six diagnostics and five quality scores without duplicating Engine physics. Sixteen actual graph jobs require 33 Agent executions; corrupt evidence blocks decisions, while five standalone cancellations and explicit same-task recovery require ten executions. A public graph-job follow-up connects native activity to the existing watchdog and preserves dispatch ownership across cancelled heartbeats without renewing state or admitting outputs. Ten diagnostic-stage cancellations and ten explicit recovery graphs require sixty Agent executions. A queue follow-up adds twenty cancellations and twenty explicit recovery graphs in one hundred Agent executions without dispatching queued work or changing old observations. Throttled node progress now retains lease/job/claim fencing and controlled 300-node graphs cannot enter dependent scoring after cancellation. A separate dispatch guard now fences typed solves and bounded native diagnostics/scoring before admission and on capacity retries; twelve controlled public-cancellation runner cases and twenty-four actual-client TCP failure cases block new admission, peer retries and extra journal attempts without liveness writes or Agent health penalties. Stokes RPC/program names align through the registry. This is contract/recovery evidence, not exhaustive admission races, general TaskIR solver support, arbitrary parallel graph cancellation, numerical/scale/installed/remote qualification or durable continuation.",
